{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20099","headline":"感别送从叔校书简再登科东归 · 孟郊","name":"感别送从叔校书简再登科东归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安车马道，高槐结浮阴。\n下有名利人，一人千万心。\n黄鹄多远势，沧溟无近浔。\n怡怡静退姿，泠泠思归吟。\n菱唱忽生听，芸书回望深。\n清风散言笑，余花缀衣襟。\n独恨鱼鸟别，一飞将一沈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20099.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20099","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}